`banner.bnr` and `icon.icn` both built cleanly in that run, and the only error left is that `meta/app.rsf` was missing `HandleTableSize: 512` and `SystemControlInfo` for `makerom`.

[file-tag: app.rsf]

Replace `meta/app.rsf` in your repository with this updated file (or just add `HandleTableSize: 512` under `AccessControlInfo:` in `meta/app.rsf`) and commit to finish building `Llama3DS.cia` and `Llama3DS_QR.png`.
